\frac{1}{2} J_b = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 48 = 24\n$$\n\nSo, **Andrea has 24 bananas**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Add all the fruits together\n\nNow, we add all the fruits:\n\n- Andrea's apples: 52  \n- Andrea's bananas: 24  \n- Jamal's apples: 44  \n- Jamal's bananas: 48\n\nTotal number of fruits:\n\n$$\n52 + 24 + 44 + 48 = \\boxed{168}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{168}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 2.8304095999337733, "draft_calls": 79, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 66, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "b4562dc664748ec2da6e0f1ccac13820bfd0fa9c413a7a3235ebec5f1d84b613", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "93286e245ee7399ce06d3e4a2686a389031d4e9b42e7dcfbbfa3cc8fb7ec6c73", "output_tokens": 547, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20624044544, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20862468096, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1996a72dbf80558f", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 412.1544966697693, "prefill_full_target": 31.957632064819336, "prefill_relay": 0.21929599344730377, "relay": 21.578816056251526, "unattributed_runtime": 37.568079221993685, "verification_full_target": 2361.1296348571777}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "168", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 2.864607954863459, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20862468096, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20812136448, "sampling_seed": 4935120641620247209, "sampling_temperature": 1.0, "target_calls": 79, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.032301707193255424, "turn_index": 0}
